AWS EKS - HOSPITAL APPLICATION (FREE TIER FRIENDLY)

EC2 (Bastion Host)

Name: bastion-host

OS: Ubuntu 22.04

Instance Type: t3.medium

Storage: 30 GB

--------------------------------------------------

Connect EC2

ssh -i your-key.pem ubuntu@<PUBLIC-IP>

sudo su

--------------------------------------------------

Update Server

apt update -y

--------------------------------------------------

Create Installation Script

nano cluster.sh

Paste:

#!/bin/bash

apt update -y

apt install -y unzip curl

curl "https://awscli.amazonaws.com/awscli-exe-linux-x86_64.zip" -o awscliv2.zip

unzip awscliv2.zip

./aws/install

curl -LO "https://dl.k8s.io/release/$(curl -L -s https://dl.k8s.io/release/stable.txt)/bin/linux/amd64/kubectl"

chmod +x kubectl

mv kubectl /usr/local/bin/

curl --silent --location "https://github.com/weaveworks/eksctl/releases/latest/download/eksctl_$(uname -s)_amd64.tar.gz" | tar xz

mv eksctl /usr/local/bin/

Save:

CTRL + O

ENTER

CTRL + X

--------------------------------------------------

Run Script

chmod 777 cluster.sh

./cluster.sh

--------------------------------------------------

Verify

aws --version

kubectl version --client

eksctl version

--------------------------------------------------

Configure AWS

aws configure

Access Key: YOUR_ACCESS_KEY

Secret Key: YOUR_SECRET_KEY

Region: ap-southeast-1

Output: json

--------------------------------------------------

Create EKS Cluster

eksctl create cluster 
--name mohit-cluster 
--version 1.31 
--region ap-southeast-1 
--nodegroup-name mohit-nodes 
--node-type t3.medium 
--nodes 2 
--nodes-min 2 
--nodes-max 2 
--managed

--------------------------------------------------

Verify Cluster

kubectl get nodes

Expected:

2 Worker Nodes Ready

--------------------------------------------------

Clone Project

git clone https://github.com/Mohitind241/Hospital-Application.git

cd Hospital-Application

--------------------------------------------------

Deploy Application

kubectl apply -f namespace.yaml

kubectl apply -f configMap.yaml

kubectl apply -f secret.yaml

kubectl apply -f pv.yaml

kubectl apply -f pvc.yaml

kubectl apply -f deployment.yaml

kubectl apply -f service.yaml

--------------------------------------------------

Verify

kubectl get pods

kubectl get svc

kubectl get pv

kubectl get pvc

kubectl get all

--------------------------------------------------

Install Helm

curl https://raw.githubusercontent.com/helm/helm/main/scripts/get-helm-3 | bash

helm version

--------------------------------------------------

Helm

helm create hospital-app-chart

cd hospital-app-chart

helm lint .

helm template hospital-release .

helm install hospital-release .

helm list

--------------------------------------------------

Access Application

kubectl get svc

Copy EXTERNAL-IP

Open:

http://EXTERNAL-IP

--------------------------------------------------

Cleanup After Demo (IMPORTANT)

eksctl delete cluster 
--name mohit-cluster 
--region ap-southeast-1

This stops AWS billing.
